.TH MATRIXD 8 "@HIDLOOM_VERSION@" "HIDloom" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
matrixd \- native keyboard matrix scanner daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B matrixd
[\fICONFIG_JSON\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B matrixd
scans the keyboard matrix and forwards compact press/release events to logicd
or hidloom-logicd-core. The default packaged configuration is
\fB/usr/lib/hidloom/config/default/matrixd.json\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show command help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MATRIXD_EVENT_LOG_PATH
Enables privacy-bounded JSONL diagnostic tracing. The packaged service writes
only to the RAM-backed \fB/run/hidloom/matrixd-trace.jsonl\fR ring.
.TP
.B MATRIXD_EVENT_LOG_MAX_BYTES
Sets the per-file trace limit. The packaged service uses 4194304 bytes and
retains one rotated file, for an 8 MiB total bound.
.TP
.B MATRIXD_STATUS_PATH
Selects the runtime status JSON path, including trace and send-failure counters.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hidloom-matrixd (5),
.BR logicd (8),
.BR hidloom-logicd-core (8)
.br
Daemon documentation:
https://github.com/cqa02303/hidloom/tree/@HIDLOOM_GIT_SHA@/docs/daemon
